The reading passages, key points, hints and questions in this package were written
for Recall and are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt them for any purpose, provided you give appropriate credit
("Recall reading passages") and indicate if changes were made.

They are original texts. They were not copied from any published source. Facts were
checked against general reference knowledge, and each passage records its basis and
any hedging in its `factNotes` field.
